Hi John,

You can just include the inla.surv() call in the formula object, as follows:

f <- inla.surv(
  time=tstop,
  event=start_using,
  truncation=tstart
) ~ -1 + BIRTHYR + USEMJ + USEOD

Best,
Denis Rustand
he...@r-inla.org

